    },
    {
      "claim": "L3 oral AUC/Cmax records are for unrelated molecules and do not provide absolute F for the query; rivastigmine carbamate exposure records (C49, C54, C55, C63, C85, C91) lack F and involve a tertiary-amine carbamate, not a quaternary pyridinium.",
      "card_ids": ["C49","C54","C55","C63","C85","C91"]
    },
    {
      "claim": "No affirmative threshold-relevant evidence supports F>=20% for the query; the permanent positive charge and low-F carbamate precedents support F<20%.",
